 "description": "Use this when the user wants to list free Smart Links for one artist, including release title, public URL, publish state, claim state, render state, and theme. Do not use this for paid campaign lists; use dynamoi_list_campaigns for campaigns. In the final answer, show public URLs and avoid internal IDs unless asked. If empty for an artist with connected Spotify, suggest dynamoi_create_smart_links_from_spotify_artist for catalog import or dynamoi_create_smart_link_from_spotify for one release instead of stopping at 'no Smart Links yet'.",
